  <p>Compared with standing up your own OCR stack, the managed path skips the GPU-or-CPU sizing question, the model updates, and the per-language tuning. You send pixels and get text. For the teams reading this page, the engineering time avoided is usually the larger line in the buy-versus-build math.</p>

